OL,3,GNEWSAFamily to return home after five
OL,4,Ayears at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family from the Isle of Man is
OL,7,Freturning home after spending five
OL,8,Fyears at sea aboard the world's largest
OL,9,Ffloating book fair.
OL,11,FAndy Sheath, his wife Rebecca and
OL,12,Fdaughters Elsie and Sofie have lived on
OL,13,Fthe Logos Hope since 2021.
OL,15,FThe vessel, which is due to dock in
OL,16,FDouglas Harbour between 6 and 22
OL,17,FNovember, is home to more than 300
OL,18,Fpeople from 60 countries and travels
OL,19,Fthe world as the largest floating book
OL,20,Ffair.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
